as directed by your healthcare practitioner.'}, {'id': 126313, 'key': '_warnings', 'value': 'Consult your healthcare professional before use, especially if taking medication. Do not use if the tamper seal is damaged. Store in a cool, dry place out of reach of children.'}, {'id': 126314, 'key': 'product_downloadables', 'value': 'https://store.doctorsstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Optimag-Plus-Calcium-Pear-30-Servings_infosheet.pdf'}, {'id': 126315, 'key': 'product_ingredients', 'value': '<div>\r\n  <h1>Supplement Facts</h1>\r\n  <p><strong>Serving Size:</strong> 1 Scoop (about 6.8 g)</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Servings Per Container:</strong> About 30</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Amount Per Serving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Calories:</strong> 20</li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <strong>Total Carbohydrate:</strong> 3 g (1%† Daily Value)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Dietary Fiber:</strong> 1 g (4% Daily Value)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calcium (as DimaCal® di-calcium malate):</strong> 600 mg (46% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Magnesium (as Albion® di-magnesium malate and TRAACS® magnesium lysinate glycinate chelate):</strong> 300 mg (71% Daily Value)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>† Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p><strong>Other Ingredients:</strong> Citric acid, malic acid, guar gum, natural flavors (no MSG), stevia extract, and riboflavin (for color).</p>\r\n</div>\r\n'}, {'id': 224398, 'key': '_main_inventory_expired_stock', 'value': ''}, {'id': 224399, 'key': '_main_inventory_is_expired', 'value': 'no'}, {'id': 356999, 'key': '_wcsatt_default_status', 'value': ''}, {'id': 357001, 'key': '_wcsatt_layout', 'value': 'flat'}, {'id': 369945, 'key': '_op_qty_warehouse_276941', 'value': ''}, {'id': 369946, 'key': '_hide_pos_website_276941', 'value': 'yes'}, {'id': 369947, 'key': 'wcmo_product_restriction_method', 'value': 'no-restriction'}, {'id': 369948, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_ids', 'val