2026-04-14 21:11:34,103 INFO crm.views views:11592 [PRODUCT_WEBHOOK] Raw request body decoded: {"id":2111,"name":"Optimetabolix Vanilla Delight Packets (10 Servings)","slug":"optimetabolix-vanilla-delight-10-servings","permalink":"https:\/\/store.doctorsstudio.com\/product\/optimetabolix-vanilla-delight-10-servings\/","date_created":"2024-07-04T11:34:16","date_created_gmt":"2024-07-04T15:34:16","date_modified":"2026-04-14T20:40:01","date_modified_gmt":"2026-04-15T00:40:01","type":"simple","status":"publish","featured":false,"catalog_visibility":"visible","description":"<p>OptiMetaboliX\u2122 Vanilla Delight No Added Sugar, No Stevia by XYMOGEN\u00ae combines InSea\u00b2\u00ae\u2014a blend of purified polyphenols from wild-crafted brown seaweed that slows carbohydrate digestion and assimilation\u2014with VegaPro\u2122, a proprietary vegetable protein sourced from pea and rice proteins. It also includes CinSulin\u00ae, a patented water extract of cinnamon, benfotiamine to boost transketolase activity, alpha-lipoic acid, green tea leaf extract, and essential minerals like vanadium, chromium, and zinc as Albion\u00ae TRAACS\u00ae chelates. Activated B vitamins, including 5-MTHF as Quatrefolic\u00ae, are incorporated for enhanced bioavailability. This formula supports healthy glucose uptake, glycogen synthesis, insulin action, and blood lipid levels already within the normal range. Sweetened with monk fruit, it avoids added sugars and the aftertaste of stevia. Free from common allergens such as soy, egg, gluten, shellfish, animal products, fish, yeast, tree nuts, wheat, dairy, and peanuts, it caters to various dietary needs.<\/p>\n","short_description":"<p>OptiMetaboliX\u2122 Vanilla Delight No Added Sugar, No Stevia by XYMOGEN\u00ae is a vegan protein formula designed to support healthy glucose and insulin metabolism, body composition, and antioxidant activity.<\/p>\n","sku":"000000000300084562","price":"69.99","regular_price":"69.99","sale_price":"","date_on_sale_from"