 <p><strong>Serving Size:<\/strong> 1 Packet (about 46 g)<\/p>\r\n  <p><strong>Servings Per Container:<\/strong> 10<\/p>\r\n  <p><strong>Amount Per Serving:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Calories:<\/strong> 160<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Total Fat:<\/strong> 5 g (6%* Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Saturated Fat:<\/strong> 1.5 g (8%* Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <strong>Total Carbohydrate:<\/strong> 15 g (5%* Daily Value)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Dietary Fiber:<\/strong> 10 g (36% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>Total Sugars:<\/strong> 1 g (**)<\/li>\r\n      <\/ul>\r\n    <\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Protein (from Pea Protein Isolate and Rice Protein Concentrate):<\/strong> 21 g<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Niacin (as niacinamide):<\/strong> 40 mg (250% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin B6 (as pyridoxal 5'-phosphate):<\/strong> 5 mg (294% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Folate (as [6S]-5-methyltetrahydrofolic acid, glucosamine salt)<sup>S1<\/sup>:<\/strong> 200 mcg DFE (50% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin B12 (as methylcobalamin):<\/strong> 50 mcg (2083% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Biotin:<\/strong> 5000 mcg (16,667% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Pantothenic Acid (as d-calcium pantothenate):<\/strong> 35 mg (700% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calcium (naturally occurring):<\/strong> 25 mg (2% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Iron (naturally occurring):<\/strong> 4 mg (22% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Zinc (as zinc bisglycinate chelate)<sup>S2<\/sup>:<\/strong> 15 mg (136% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Chromium (as chromium nicotinate glycinate chelate)<sup>S2<\/sup>:<\/strong> 500 mcg (1429% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Sodium (naturally occurring):<\/strong> 430 mg (19% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Potassium (from tripotassium citrate and ingredients with naturally occurring potassium):<\/strong> 410 mg (9% Daily Value)<