rsstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Optimetabolix-Vanilla-Delight-10-Servings_infosheet.pdf'}, {'id': 126323, 'key': 'product_ingredients', 'value': "<div>\r\n  <h1>Supplement Facts</h1>\r\n  <p><strong>Serving Size:</strong> 1 Packet (about 46 g)</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Servings Per Container:</strong> 10</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Amount Per Serving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Calories:</strong> 160</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Total Fat:</strong> 5 g (6%* Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Saturated Fat:</strong> 1.5 g (8%* Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <strong>Total Carbohydrate:</strong> 15 g (5%* Daily Value)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Dietary Fiber:</strong> 10 g (36% Daily Value)</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Total Sugars:</strong> 1 g (**)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>Protein (from Pea Protein Isolate and Rice Protein Concentrate):</strong> 21 g</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Niacin (as niacinamide):</strong> 40 mg (250% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin B6 (as pyridoxal 5'-phosphate):</strong> 5 mg (294% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Folate (as [6S]-5-methyltetrahydrofolic acid, glucosamine salt)<sup>S1</sup>:</strong> 200 mcg DFE (50% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin B12 (as methylcobalamin):</strong> 50 mcg (2083% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Biotin:</strong> 5000 mcg (16,667% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Pantothenic Acid (as d-calcium pantothenate):</strong> 35 mg (700% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calcium (naturally occurring):</strong> 25 mg (2% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Iron (naturally occurring):</strong> 4 mg (22% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Zinc (as zinc bisglycinate chelate)<sup>S2</sup>:</strong> 15 mg (136% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Chromium (as chromium nicotinate glycinate chelate)<sup>S2</sup>:</strong> 500 mcg (1429% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Sodium (naturally occurring):</strong> 430 mg (19% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Potassium (from tripotassium citrate and ingredients with naturally occurring potassium):</strong> 410 mg (9% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Brown Seaweed Blend (Ascophyllum nodosum and Fucus vesiculosus) (20% polyphenols)<sup>S3</sup>:</strong> 500 mg (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Cinnamon 10:1 Aqueous Extract (Cinnamomum cassia) (bark)<sup>S4</sup>:</strong> 200 mg (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Organic Green Tea Aqueous Extract (Camellia sinensis) (leaf) (25% polyphenols, 15% catechins, &lt;10% caffeine):</strong> 200 mg (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Alpha-Lipoic Acid:</strong> 200 mg (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Benfotiamine:</strong> 50 mg (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vanadium (as vanadium nicotinate glycinate chelate)<sup>S2</sup>:</strong> 2.5 mg (**)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>* Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.</p>\r\n  <p>** Daily Value not established.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p><strong>Other Ingredients:</strong> Inulin (from chicory), natural flavors (no MSG), sunflower oil, cellulose gum, xanthan gum, taurine, glycine, medium-chain triglyceride oil, fungal proteases<sup>S5</sup>, guar gum, L-glutamine, and monk fruit extract.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n"}, {'id': 224402, 'key': '_main_inventory_expired_stock', 'value': ''}, {'id': 224403, 'key': '_main_inventory_is_expired', 'value': 'no'}, {'id': 357007, 'key': '_wcsatt_default_status', 'value': ''}, {'id': 357009, 'key': '_wcsatt_layout', 'value': 'flat'}, {'id': 372001, 'key': '_op_qty_warehouse_276941', 'value': ''}, {'id': 372002, 'key': '_hide_pos_website_276941', 'value': 'yes'}, {'id': 372003, 'key': 'wcmo_product_restriction_method', 'value': 'no-restriction'}, {'id': 372004, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_ids', 'value': ''}, {'id': 372005, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_select', 'value': ''}, {'id': 372006, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_roles', 'value': ''}, {'id': 372007, 'key': 'wcmo_hide_from_user_roles', 'value': ''}, {'id': 372008, 'key': 'wcmo_product_exclude_from_archive