out of reach of children.'}, {'id': 126471, 'key': 'product_downloadables', 'value': 'https://store.doctorsstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Prenatal-Essentials-Capsules-150-ct_infosheet.pdf'}, {'id': 126472, 'key': 'product_ingredients', 'value': '<div>\r\n  <h1 style="color: white">Supplement Facts</h1>\r\n  <p><strong>Serving Size:</strong> 5 Capsules</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Servings Per Container:</strong> 30</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Amount Per Serving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin A</strong> (60% as natural beta-carotene and 40% as retinyl palmitate): 1500 mcg (115% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin C</strong> (ascorbic acid): 100 mg (83% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin D3</strong> (cholecalciferol): 50 mcg (2000 IU) (333% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin E</strong> (as d-alpha tocopheryl succinate): 134 mg (705% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Thiamin</strong> (as thiamine HCl): 5 mg (357% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Riboflavin</strong> (as riboflavin 5\'-phosphate sodium): 5 mg (313% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Niacin</strong> (as niacinamide): 25 mg (139% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin B6</strong> (as pyridoxal 5\'-phosphate): 20 mg (1000% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Folate</strong> (as (6S)-5-methyltetrahydrofolic acid glucosamine salt<sup>S1</sup> and as calcium folinate): 1360 mcg DFE (227% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin B12</strong> (as methylcobalamin): 50 mcg (1786% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Biotin:</strong> 300 mcg (857% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Pantothenic Acid</strong> (as d-calcium pantothenate): 25 mg (357% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Choline</strong> (as choline dihydrogen citrate): 200 mg (36% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calcium</strong> (as dicalcium malate<sup>S2</sup>): 400 mg (31% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Iron</strong> (as ferrous bisglycinate chelate<sup>S2</sup>): 30 mg (111% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Iodine</strong> (as potassium iodide): 225 mcg (78% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Magnesium</strong> (as dimagnesium malate<sup>S2</sup>): 200 mg (50% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Zinc</strong> (as zinc bisglycinate chelate<sup>S2</sup>): 20 mg (154% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Selenium</strong> (as L-selenomethionine): 100 mcg (143% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Copper</strong> (as copper bisglycinate chelate<sup>S2</sup>): 2 mg (154% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Manganese</strong> (as manganese bisglycinate chelate<sup>S2</sup>): 5 mg (192% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Chromium</strong> (as chromium nicotinate glycinate chelate<sup>S2</sup>): 100 mcg (222% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Molybdenum</strong> (as molybdenum glycinate chelate<sup>S2</sup>): 100 mcg (200% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin K2</strong> (as menaquinone-7): 100 mcg (**)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>** Daily Value not established.</p>\r\n  <p>All Formulas Meet or Exceed cGMP Quality Standards.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3 style="color: white">Other Ingredients</h3>\r\n  <p>Capsule (hypromellose and water), microcrystalline cellulose, ascorbyl palmitate, silica, medium-chain triglyceride oil, and mixed tocopherols.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n'}, {'id': 224924, 'key': '_main_inventory_expired_stock', 'value': ''}, {'id': 224925, 'key': '_main_inventory_is_expired', 'value': 'no'}, {'id': 357105, 'key': '_wcsatt_default_status', 'value': ''}, {'id': 357107, 'key': '_wcsatt_layout', 'value': 'flat'}, {'id': 380599, 'key': '_op_qty_warehouse_276941', 'value': ''}, {'id': 380600, 'key': '_hide_pos_website_276941', 'value': 'yes'}, {'id': 380601, 'key': 'wcmo_product_restriction_method', 'value': 'no-restriction'}, {'id': 380602, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_ids', 'value': ''}, {'id': 380603, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_select', 'value': ''}, {'id': 380604, 'key': 'wcmo_product_user_roles', 'value': ''}, {'id': 380605, 'ke