ur healthcare professional prior to use. Individuals taking blood thinners or other medication, as well as those with bleeding disorders, should discuss potential interactions and contraindications with their healthcare professional. Do not use if tamper seal is damaged. Storage: Keep closed in a cool, dry place out of reach of children.'}, {'id': 126608, 'key': 'product_downloadables', 'value': 'https://store.doctorsstudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Proteoxyme-Capsules-100-ct_infosheet.pdf'}, {'id': 126609, 'key': 'product_ingredients', 'value': '<div>\r\n  <h1 style="color: white">Supplement Facts</h1>\r\n  <p><strong>Serving Size:</strong> 5 Capsules</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Servings Per Container:</strong> 20</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Amount Per Serving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <strong>Pancreatin 10X (from porcine):</strong> 500 mg (**)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li>Pancreatic Protease: 125,000 USP (**)</li>\r\n        <li>Pancreatic Amylase: 125,000 USP (**)</li>\r\n        <li>Pancreatic Lipase: 10,000 USP (**)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>Rutin:</strong> 250 mg (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Bromelain:</strong> 225 mg (540 GDU) (**)</li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <strong>Trypsin Complex (from porcine):</strong> 150 mg (**)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li>Trypsin: 288,000 USP (**)</li>\r\n        <li>Chymotrypsin: 37,500 USP (**)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>Papain:</strong> 114 mg (4,800,000 PU) (**)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Serrapeptase:</strong> 27 mg (60,000 SPU) (**)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>** Daily Value not established.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3 style="color: white">Other Ingredients</h3>\r\n  <p>Acid-resistant capsule (hypromellose, gellan gum, and water), inulin, stearic acid, magnesium stearate, and silica.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n'}, {'id': 225192, 'key': '_main_inventory_expired_stock', 'value': ''}, {'id': 225193, 'key': '_main_inventory_is_expired', 'value': 'no'}, {'id': 357326, 'key': '_wcsatt_default_stat