l Carbohydrate:<\/strong> 1 g (&lt;1%\u2020)<\/li>\r\n        <li>\r\n            <strong>Calcium (as calcium carbonate, calcium oxide, and calcium chloride anhydrous):<\/strong> 75 mg (6% Daily Value)\r\n        <\/li>\r\n        <li><strong>Betaine Anhydrous (trimethylglycine):<\/strong> 600 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n        <li>\r\n            <strong>S-adenosyl-L-methionine (as S-adenosyl-L-methionine 1,4-butandisulfonate):<\/strong> 400 mg (**)\r\n        <\/li>\r\n    <\/ul>\r\n\r\n    <p>\u2020 Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.<\/p>\r\n    <p>** Daily Value not established.<\/p>\r\n\r\n    <h3 style=\"color: white\">Other Ingredients<\/h3>\r\n    <p>Xylitol, citric acid, malic acid, stearic acid, silica, natural lemon flavor, and turmeric extract (for color).<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n"},{"id":225904,"key":"_main_inventory_expired_stock","value":""},{"id":225905,"key":"_main_inventory_is_expired","value":"no"},{"id":357477,"key":"_wcsatt_default_status","value":""},{"id":357479,"key":"_wcsatt_layout","value":"flat"},{"id":379800,"key":"_op_qty_warehouse_276941","value":""},{"id":379801,"key":"_hide_pos_website_276941","value":"yes"},{"id":379802,"key":"wcmo_product_restriction_method","value":"no-restriction"},{"id":379803,"key":"wcmo_product_user_ids","value":""},{"id":379804,"key":"wcmo_product_user_select","value":""},{"id":379805,"key":"wcmo_product_user_roles","value":""},{"id":379806,"key":"wcmo_hide_from_user_roles","value":""},{"id":379807,"key":"wcmo_product_exclude_from_archives","value":""},{"id":379808,"key":"wcmo_product_passwords","value":""},{"id":379809,"key":"wcmo_product_assign_roles","value":""},{"id":379810,"key":"wcmo_product_expires_after_value","value":""},{"id":379811,"key":"wcmo_product_expires_after_period","value":""},{"id":379812,"key":"wcmo_product_reminder_before_value","value":""},{"id":379813,"key":"wcmo_product_reminder_before_period","value":""},{"id":379814,"key":"wcmo_product_sub_cancelled_roles","value":""},{"id":379