iption_one_time_shipping', 'value': 'no'}, {'id': 357516, 'key': '_suggested_use', 'value': 'Mix 1 scoop (5 g) in 4 to 6 oz. of water. For best results, drink immediately after mixing. Store in a cool, dry place. Consume within 45 days of opening.'}, {'id': 357517, 'key': '_warnings', 'value': 'Consult your healthcare practitioner before use, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medications, or have a medical condition. Keep out of reach of children.'}, {'id': 357518, 'key': '_wcsatt_default_status', 'value': ''}, {'id': 357520, 'key': '_wcsatt_force_subscription', 'value': 'no'}, {'id': 357521, 'key': '_wcsatt_layout', 'value': 'flat'}, {'id': 357522, 'key': 'product_downloadables', 'value': '0'}, {'id': 357523, 'key': 'product_ingredients', 'value': '<div>\r\n  <h1 style="color: white">Supplement Facts</h1>\r\n  <p><strong>Serving Size:</strong> 1 Teaspoon (5 g)</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Servings Per Container:</strong> 30</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Amount Per Serving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Calories:</strong> 15</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Total Fat:</strong> 0 g (0% Daily Value)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li>Trans Fat 0 g</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>Sodium:</strong> 65 mg (3% Daily Value)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Total Carbohydrates:</strong> 4 g (1% Daily Value)\r\n      <ul>\r\n        <li>Total Sugars 3 g</li>\r\n        <li>Includes 0 g Added Sugars (0% Daily Value)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>Protein:</strong> 1 g (2%)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Potassium:</strong> 160 mg (3%)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Vitamin C:</strong> 50 mg (56%)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Magnesium:</strong> 18 mg (4%)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Manganese:</strong> 0.14 mg (6%)</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>* The % Daily Value (DV) tells you how much a nutrient in a serving of food contributes to a daily diet. 2,000 calories a day is used for general nutrition advice.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Non-GMO Beetroot Powder, No