E (85% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calcium (as tricalcium phosphate and calcium d-glucarate tetrahydrate):<\/strong> 75 mg (6% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Selenium (as methylselenocysteine):<\/strong> 15 mcg (27% Daily Value)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calcium D-Glucarate Tetrahydrate:<\/strong> 250 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Green Tea Aqueous Extract (Camellia sinensis) (leaf) (60% catechins, 30% EGCG, 6% caffeine):<\/strong> 250 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Alpha-Lipoic Acid:<\/strong> 100 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>N-Acetyl-L-Cysteine:<\/strong> 100 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Milk Thistle Extract (Silybum marianum) (seed) (30% silybins):<\/strong> 100 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>DIM (diindolylmethane):<\/strong> 75 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Quercetin (as quercetin dihydrate) (from Sophora japonica) (bud):<\/strong> 50 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Turmeric Extract (Curcuma longa) (rhizome) (95% curcuminoids):<\/strong> 50 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>trans-Resveratrol (as Polygonum cuspidatum root extract):<\/strong> 18.5 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>trans-Pterostilbene:<\/strong> 15.5 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Glucoraphanin (from broccoli extract) (Brassica oleracea italica) (seed):<\/strong> 15 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Dihydroquercetin:<\/strong> 5 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n    <li><strong>Black Pepper Extract (Piper nigrum) (fruit):<\/strong> 5 mg (**)<\/li>\r\n  <\/ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>** Daily Value not established.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3 style=\"color: white\">Other Ingredients<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Capsule (hypromellose and water), stearic acid, magnesium stearate, and silica.<\/p>\r\n<\/div>\r\n"},{"id":175661,"key":"_main_inventory_expired_stock","value":""},{"id":175662,"key":"_main_inventory_is_expired","value":"no"},{"id":357836,"key":"_subscription_one_time_shipping","value":"no"},{"id":357837,"key":"_wcsatt_default_status","value":""},{"id":357839,"key":"_wcsatt_force_subscription","value":"no"},{"i